From 8ccafd9769520cbc34439e3a12ec506f546f9da1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nan Zhang <quic_nanzhan@quicinc.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Nov 2022 16:13:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libavb: modify libavb to align with container avb.

To add container_id in AvbOps.
Modify avb_slot_verify API.

Upsteam-Status: Pending

Change-Id: Idef4676789f54c48afe3ddb4bcb87a555a158c9c
Signed-off-by: Nan Zhang <quic_nanzhan@quicinc.com>
---
 libavb/avb_ops.h          |  26 +++++++
 libavb/avb_slot_verify.c  | 194 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------------------
 libavb/avb_vbmeta_image.c |  33 ++++++--
 libavb/avb_vbmeta_image.h |  11 ++-
 4 files changed, 169 insertions(+), 95 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libavb/avb_ops.h b/libavb/avb_ops.h
index dec163d..1bfa9d9 100644
--- a/libavb/avb_ops.h
+++ b/libavb/avb_ops.h
@@ -22,6 +22,13 @@
  * SOFTWARE.
  */
 
+/*
+ * Changes from Qualcomm Innovation Center are provided under the following license:
